r Videos angesehen und eure Kommentare gelesen und deshalb einiges verändert. Hier sind die Änderungen, die ihr am meisten merken werdet, kurz und einfach. Komplett neue Grafik Wir haben die alte, KI-generierte Grafik durch neue Grafik von einem Künstler ersetzt. Jeder Slime sieht jetzt sauberer und glatter aus. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46347303/3bc96215ea6493d49a79447094301e47fa610cf0.jpg {STEA","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T19:48:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939256","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:37:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5290610-1844751498226237","game_id":"steam-5290610","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for joining the horde!","summary":"Hi everyone! The Slime Break store page went live on September 23, and the first wishlists started coming in right away. Every one of them was seen and celebrated here. Thank you for joining the horde this early! What's being worked on right now Balancing the towers and their level III evolutions Full controller support, Xbox and PlayStation 15 languages Linux and SteamOS How you can help Add Slime Break to your wishlist and follow the game, so you get notified at launch Share it with a friend w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T00:24:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226237","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:37:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5290610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:31:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:31:25Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5290610":"2026-10-26T09:31:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5290610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:31:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26